          "payload": {
            "name": "paperclip-get_task_context",
            "output": "{\"content\":\"{\\\"acceptedPlan\\\":null,\\\"activeTask\\\":{\\\"assigneeAgentId\\\":\\\"f4c7cef4-5228-4815-9880-3db2042dbcf3\\\",\\\"companyId\\\":\\\"6a051e4f-7ace-4ec9-8ab1-dc3b025d9c1c\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Run the supplied exact command once using native bash with mode async and detach false.\\\\nAfter starting it, attempt to finish immediately without calling read\\\\\\\\_bash or another waiting tool. The attached-process runtime must settle the command before ending the turn.\\\\nDo not modify fixture code, manufacture its result, or start another command.\\\\nThe fixture-owned marker is a private diagnostic sentinel, not a requested file deliverable. Do not publish or attach it.\\\\nCall paperclip\\\\\\\\_finish with reportedWorkDisposition done, summary COPILOT-PROTECTION-attached-async-settlement-1b6ca90f2748-1, current completion contract revision, satisfied objective criterion, no remaining work, evidence \\\\\\\\[], verification \\\\\\\\[]. After acceptance reply with that exact summary.\\\\nThe exact supplied command is:\\\\n'/private/tmp/paperclip-pi-v5-node-20260928/darwin-arm64/node' '/tmp/pc-copilot-mt2vtc/client.cjs' '/tmp/pc-copilot-mt2vtc/private/socket' '22a1e053ebaa01263678e1942d9bfbfb'\\\\nDo not inspect or modify fixture code, fabricate its marker, or launch a substitute command.\\\",\\\"executionRunId\\\":\\\"63f9b9e9-4797-43eb-bf3d-4449d784c574\\\",\\\"goalId\\\":null,\\\"id\\\":\\\"d1c7dfa0-d11c-45d1-8632-88a8c91eadc6\\\",\\\"identifier\\\":\\\"RUN-1\\\",\\\"parentId\\\":null,\\\"priority\\\":\\\"medium\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"7c4c67a8-aa32-41e4-aa80-6517c6947b49\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"in_progress\\\",\\\"statusVersion\\\":1,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Copilot attached-async-settlement 1b6ca90f2748-1\\\",\\\"titleNeedsGeneration\\\":false,\\\"url\\\":null,\\\"workMode\\\":\\\"standard\\\"},\\\"actor\\\":{\\\"capabilities\\\":\\\"Completes deterministic standard, planning, and ask-mode runner acceptance tasks.\\\",\\\"companyId\\\":\\\"6a051e4f-7ace-4ec9-8ab1-dc3b025d9c1c\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f4c7cef4-5228-4815-9880-3db2042dbcf3\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Runner E2E runner-acpx-copilot 1b6ca90f2748-1\\\",\\\"reportsTo\\\":null,\\\"role\\\":\\\"qa\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"running\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Paid full-stack runner acceptance fixture\\\"},\\\"childReviewOutcomes\\\":[],\\\"childTasks\\\":[],\\\"childTasksTruncated\\\":false,\\\"company\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6a051e4f-7ace-4ec9-8ab1-dc3b025d9c1c\\\"},\\\"connectionGuidance\\\":\\\"Connection tools:\\\\n- When the user asks to connect a service, call `connections_search` before any service tool, even if already installed. Also search when a task needs a service and usable access is uncertain. Search by its name or capability and follow the returned `instruction`.\\\\n- Use the returned service identifiers and connection tools for setup. Respect recorded user choices; never invent access or ask for credentials in comments.\\\\n- When waiting for user action, finish independent work, then yield without retrying or polling. On continuation, follow the recorded outcome and use the installed connection.\\\\n- Do not use connection tools for arbitrary MCP URLs or unrelated work.\\\",\\\"delegationGuidance\\\":\\\"Reuse existing child tasks for delegated work. Inspect a completed child's comments and documents before creating another task for the same deliverable. Use search_tasks if the child task list is truncated.\\\",\\\"run\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"63f9b9e9-4797-43eb-bf3d-4449d784c574\\\",\\\"invocationSource\\\":\\\"assignment\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"running\\\"},\\\"sourcePlanApproval\\\":null}{\\\"schema\\\":\\\"paperclip.semantic_tool_receipt.v2\\\",\\\"operationId\\\":\\\"get_task_context\\\",\\\"callIdentitySha256\\\":\\\"4e07408562bedb8b60ce05c1decfe3ad16b72230967de01f640b7e4729b49fce\\\",\\\"inputSha256\\\":\\\"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a\\\",\\\"resultSha256\\\":\\\"491c7c90831af3856eed247c429da34e